{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00388",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.87,
      "end_seconds": 2.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Morning! Make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.28,
      "end_seconds": 4.25,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Hi. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.67,
      "end_seconds": 7.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Did you come far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.66,
      "end_seconds": 12.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Well, not too far, about half an hour by bus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.05,
      "end_seconds": 14.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Right, what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.73,
      "end_seconds": 19.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got burning in both feet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.82,
      "end_seconds": 27.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.08,
      "end_seconds": 32.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Well, it's been going on for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.58,
      "end_seconds": 36.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.65,
      "end_seconds": 45.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "I, I'd say severe. I mean, I did have numbness in the toes at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.7,
      "end_seconds": 49.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.74,
      "end_seconds": 50.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.02,
      "end_seconds": 63.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Have you had any bladder problems, back pain or weakness in the legs?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.93,
      "end_seconds": 70.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "No bladder problems, back pain or weakness in the legs, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.05,
      "end_seconds": 74.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.87,
      "end_seconds": 77.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Oh, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.39,
      "end_seconds": 80.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.88,
      "end_seconds": 89.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.77,
      "end_seconds": 95.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "So, what about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.09,
      "end_seconds": 102.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "An underactive thyroid, for two years. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.7,
      "end_seconds": 107.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.01,
      "end_seconds": 108.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.87,
      "end_seconds": 123.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Okay, do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.31,
      "end_seconds": 127.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Right, yes, pollen, it gives me sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.03,
      "end_seconds": 133.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Alright, have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.2,
      "end_seconds": 149.23,
      "duration_seconds": 15.03,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.33,
      "end_seconds": 153.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.5,
      "end_seconds": 165.01,
      "duration_seconds": 10.51,
      "text": "Thyroxine. I take it 75 micrograms, every morning. I did try to ignore it for a while. I take paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.69,
      "end_seconds": 169.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Bear with me, I need to finish this line in the notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.71,
      "end_seconds": 187.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Okay, that's done. What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.79,
      "end_seconds": 193.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "I had my thyroid operated on a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 194.09,
      "end_seconds": 202.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Blood pressure 108 over 75, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse is 86 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.89,
      "end_seconds": 208.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Thanks. Okay, is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.89,
      "end_seconds": 214.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.53,
      "end_seconds": 219.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.81,
      "end_seconds": 222.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Look straight ahead for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.96,
      "end_seconds": 243.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Feeling of light touch is reduced in both feet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.09,
      "end_seconds": 260.11,
      "duration_seconds": 14.02,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.44,
      "end_seconds": 272.2,
      "duration_seconds": 10.76,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.67,
      "end_seconds": 290.68,
      "duration_seconds": 17.01,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with peripheral neuropathy, possibly related to sugar at this stage. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had burning in both feet for nearly five years, severe, and no weakness in the legs or bladder problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.62,
      "end_seconds": 292.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.47,
      "end_seconds": 307.97,
      "duration_seconds": 13.5,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.42,
      "end_seconds": 311.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.59,
      "end_seconds": 320.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "We should do a vitamin B12 level for neuropathy. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.59,
      "end_seconds": 322.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.67,
      "end_seconds": 338.92,
      "duration_seconds": 15.25,
      "text": "I'm prescribing pregabalin, 75 milligrams, at night, for four weeks. That's for nerve pain. Check your feet every evening for cuts or blisters, you may not feel them. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.43,
      "end_seconds": 351.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.0,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. We'll refer you to podiatry. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's review you after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.43,
      "end_seconds": 354.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.95,
      "end_seconds": 364.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.29,
      "end_seconds": 379.36,
      "duration_seconds": 10.07,
      "text": "So, I take the pregabalin, 75 milligrams, at night and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.11,
      "end_seconds": 384.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.76,
      "end_seconds": 390.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "I mean, um, thank you. I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.46,
      "end_seconds": 393.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}